<title>MALAYSIA: GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third round scores</p>
<p>in the Malaysian Open golf championship on Saturday:</p>
<p>204 Harumitsu Hamano (Japan) 71 67 66</p>
<p>205 Lee Westwood (Britain) 64 72 69</p>
<p>206 Larry Barber (U.S.) 66 70 70</p>
<p>208 Mike Cunning (U.S.) 69 71 68</p>
<p>209 Brian Gay (U.S.) 72 67 70</p>
<p>210 Stephen Leaney (Australia) 71 71 68, Kyi Hla Han (Burma) 71</p>
<p>72 67, Christian Chernock (U.S.) 70 68 72</p>
</text>
